WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.973
Installation

2
00:00:01.973 --> 00:00:04.482
Open Settings → Community plugins

3
00:00:04.482 --> 00:00:06.733
Turn off restricted mode

4
00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:13.097
Browse and search for BRAT

5
00:00:13.097 --> 00:00:14.943
Install it, then enable it

6
00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:16.223
Waiting for the AI (fast-forward)

7
00:00:23.414 --> 00:00:29.564
Run BRAT: Add a beta plugin for testing

8
00:00:29.564 --> 00:00:34.897
Enter the repository sblabkribb/labnoteo

9
00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:39.882
Pick latest under Select a version

10
00:00:39.882 --> 00:00:41.909
Press Add plugin to install and enable it

11
00:00:41.909 --> 00:00:43.909
Waiting for the AI (fast-forward)

12
00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:53.407
Workflows and Samples icons appear in the ribbon
